# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
experiments/energy-inference/paper/*.log

# Claude internal state
.claude/

# Vendored lm-evaluation-harness (2026-09-13). Kept ON DISK because the eval jobs load it
# via PYTHONPATH (experiments/eval_scripts/eval_tasks.sh), but NOT tracked: it is 14,720
# files of third-party code that made every diff and `git log --stat` unreadable in this
# fork. Provenance and the exact pin live in experiments/eval_scripts/VENDORED_FROM.txt
# (upstream ad3f4d0c / v0.4.9.2, 0 local modifications), which IS tracked -- so the eval
# remains exactly reproducible without carrying the tree in history.
experiments/eval_scripts/lm-evaluation-harness/
experiments/boltzmann-moe/scripts/*.log

# Session transcripts and recovered session dumps. These are internal dialogue, not code:
# they carry candid discussion, colleague names, cluster topology and unpublished numbers.
# Keep the distilled record in PROGRESS.md / HANDOFF.md / CLAUDE.md instead.
*.jsonl
**/recovered_*_sessions/

# Editor / manual backup copies -- several of these were committed by accident.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak_*

# Runtime logs from the watchdog / babysitter drivers (watchdog.log is listed above).
experiments/boltzmann-moe/scripts/*.log

# Internal engineering log -- keep LOCAL. Contains cluster topology, quota detail and
# unpublished results. Removed from the tree 2026-09-17; note it was public 2026-09-12..17,
# so history still holds it (see SIGN_CONVENTION_UNIFICATION.md / the sanitize report).
experiments/boltzmann-moe/HANDOFF.md
